              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Christine Amsden"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Excellent recipe! It's a little different (from what I normally eat). I asked my husband to surprise me and he made this. It's sweet and creamy. It's easy to make (though not quick as it simmers for a while) and relatively inexpensive. The only change we made was to skip the lettuce because we didn't have any. I didn't miss it. Next time I may serve this over rice."
